ageList[0] = 10;
ageList[1] = 20;
System.out.println(ageList[2]);
```

What is the result of the following multi-dimensional array declaration and access?

```java
int[][] matrix = {
    {1, 2},
    {3, 4, 5}
};
System.out.println(matrix[1][2]);
```

